<title>USA: Buttrey names Joseph Fernandez chairman.</title>
<headline>Buttrey names Joseph Fernandez chairman.</headline>
<dateline>GREAT FALLS, Mont. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buttrey Food and Drug Stores Co on Friday said its board elected Joseph Fernandez as chairman, president, and chief executive officer, effective September 1.</p>
<p>Fernandez became president and chief executive officer of Buttrey in September 1993, and has been president and chief operating officer since March 1, 1993.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
